UPDATE companies SET description='Quality Plastics & Machine, Incorporated was founded in 1976 in Sparks, Nevada. The company began as a custom plastics fabricator and has since expanded into machining, forming, and assembly services.

The shop’s core process is vacuum forming of thermoplastic sheets, supplemented by drape forming for optically clear curved parts. It operates CNC machining centers including a dual-spindle lathe with live tooling, 5-axis and 3-axis routers, laser cutting systems, and 3D printers for prototypes and fixtures. Fabrication services cover trimming, riveting, threaded inserts, and hardware installation, while the assembly department handles everything from simple hardware to full electro‑mechanical builds. The company also designs and builds custom automated machinery to accelerate production runs.

Customers span laboratories, medical equipment, displays, electronics, motor vehicles, entertainment, agriculture, watercraft, aircraft, and aerospace — including components flown on multiple space‑shuttle missions.

