UPDATE companies SET description='Quantum Imaging operates as SCD USA Infrared LLC from Colorado Springs, Colorado, with a second site in Melbourne, Florida. The business was established as a fully owned U.S. subsidiary of Israel-based Semiconductor Devices (SCD), a company with more than 40 years of experience in infrared detector development. No founding year for the U.S. entity is publicly disclosed.

The company manufactures infrared detectors and integrated imaging solutions spanning the short-wave (SWIR), mid-wave (MWIR), and long-wave (LWIR) bands. Its product line includes camera cores, engines, and Integrated Detector Dewar Cooler Assemblies (IDDCA) built on semiconductor materials such as InSb, XBn, InGaAs, Type II Superlattice (T2SL), and Vanadium Oxide (VOx). The firm emphasizes its Very Large-Scale Integrated Circuit (VLSI) design capability for readout circuits and says it has delivered tens of thousands of detectors for fielded systems.

Primary customers operate in defense and homeland security — air, land, sea, missile, and surveillance domains — with named programs at Raytheon. The portfolio also serves security and surveillance markets (border, airborne, critical infrastructure, coastal, perimeter), commercial sectors (aviation, gas sensing, non-destructive testing, semiconductor inspection, process monitoring), and space applications. Applications range from missile warning systems and driver vision enhancement to furnace temperature mapping and hyperspectral imaging.

The company states its mission is to deliver innovative, field-ready, intelligent imaging and detection systems for real-time visualization of mission-critical intelligence in all theaters and environments. It differentiates itself through what it calls the industry''s broadest product offering, scalable engine and camera architectures, and material expertise covering the full infrared spectrum from NIR through LWIR.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 14001','OHSAS-18001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Infrared detector manufacturing (InSb, XBn, InGaAs, T2SL, VOx)", "Camera core assembly (MWIR, SWIR, LWIR)", "Integrated Detector Dewar Cooler Assembly (IDDCA) production", "VLSI readout integrated circuit (ROIC) design", "Environmental qualification testing", "Maintenance and repair services", "Infrared imaging solution engineering"], "industries": ["Defense", "Homeland Security", "Security & Surveillance", "Border Security", "Airborne Surveillance", "Critical Infrastructure Protection", "Coastal Security", "Perimeter Security", "Commercial Aviation", "Gas Sensing", "Non-Destructive Testing", "Semiconductor Inspection", "Process Monitoring", "Aerospace", "Space", "Law Enforcement", "Industrial Inspections", "Medical", "Hyperspectral Imaging", "Fire Detection", "Public Safety & Transportation"], "materials": ["InSb", "XBn", "InGaAs", "T2SL (Type II Superlattice)", "VOx (Vanadium Oxide)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Tens of thousands of units", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Broadest product offering in the infrared detector industry", "Scalable engine and camera architecture across SWIR, MWIR, LWIR bands", "Cooled and uncooled detector technologies covering NIR, SWIR, MWIR, LWIR", "Worldwide recognition for space imaging solutions"], "facts_used": ["Location: Colorado Springs, CO and Melbourne, FL -> /about-us", "Ownership: US-based fully owned subsidiary of SCD (Israel) -> /about-us", "Parent company experience: 40+ years -> /about-us", "Products: MWIR, SWIR, LWIR detectors, cameras, engines, IDDCA -> / (home)", "Materials: InSb, XBn, InGaAs, T2SL, VOx -> /about-us", "Volume: Tens of thousands manufactured -> / (home)", "Industries: Defense, Security, Commercial, Aerospace -> / (home), /capabilities", "Customer: Raytheon deal for SWIR cameras -> / (home) news", "Certifications: ISO 9001, AS9100D, ISO 14001, OHSAS-18001 -> /quality", "Mission statement and differentiators -> /about-us", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Tens of thousands of SCDUSA and SCD detectors and infrared imaging solutions are manufactured for deployment in demanding applications for defense customers", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/scd/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='quantum-imaging' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
