UPDATE companies SET description='R & B Steel Fabrications has operated from Rockville, Maryland since 1976, serving the District of Columbia, Maryland, and Virginia (DMV) region with snow removal equipment and related services. The company began as a supplier of snow removal products and has expanded into custom fabrication and truck upfitting.

