The business distinguishes itself through its long-standing authorized distributor relationships with multiple major brands, allowing it to offer a broad selection of equipment backed by factory support. Its combination of product distribution and in-house fabrication enables turnkey upfitting for specialized applications.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom fabrication", "Liftgate installation and service", "Custom truck upfitting", "Snow removal equipment distribution"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Authorized distributor for Western, Pro-Tech, Orec, Berlon, and Buyers Products", "Custom fabrication and truck upfitting capabilities", "Serving the DMV region since 1976"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1976 -> db", "Headquarters Rockville, Maryland -> db", "Authorized distributor for Western, Pro-Tech, Orec, Berlon, Buyers Products -> db", "Custom fabrication services -> page /", "Liftgate services -> page /", "Custom truck upfitting -> page /", "Serves DMV area -> db"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We are an authorized Western, Pro-Tech, Orec, Berlon and Buyers Products distributor", "founded_year": "1976", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='r-b-steel-fabrications' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='R&D Electronics, Inc. was founded in 1968 in Brownsboro, Alabama, as a supplier of electronic assemblies to the Department of Defense and its prime contractors for military applications.

The company operates a 38,500-square-foot facility where it manufactures a range of semi-complex to complex electronic and electro-mechanical assemblies, cable and wiring harnesses, and provides build-to-print production and contract manufacturing services. Capabilities include automatic wire cutting and stripping, laser stripping, multi-conductor and coaxial cable fabrication, open wire harness fabrication, EMI shielding, soldering to J-STD standards, custom over-molding, polyurethane molding, encapsulating and potting, conformal coating to Mil-I-46058C, and automated testing such as DC hipot up to 1,500 VDC and programmable point-to-point testers with up to 2,500 points.

R&D Electronics serves the defense and aerospace sectors, with a customer base that includes the Department of Defense, prime contractors such as Lockheed Martin Missiles & Fire Control and Lockheed Martin Aeronautics, and major weapons programs including the Army’s Multiple Launch Rocket System (MLRS) and the High Mobility Artillery Rocket System (HIMARS).

The company emphasizes Lean Six Sigma principles across its operations, maintaining certifications to AS9100 and ISO 9001, and has earned recognition including five Small Business of the Year awards (2000, 2004, 2007, 2009, 2013), a 2007 Nunn-Perry Award from Lockheed Martin Missiles & Fire Control, and the Secretary of Defense Performance-Based Logistics Award in 2006 and 2009.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','AS9100']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Automatic Wire Cut & Strip", "Laser Stripping", "Multi-conductor Cable Fabrication", "Open Wire Harness Fabrication", "Coaxial Cable Fabrication", "Large Gauge Power Cables", "EMI Shielding (Metal & Fabric over-braiding)", "Soldering (J-STD)", "Sleeving Installation", "Custom Over-molding", "Electro-mechanical Assembly", "Laser Wire Marking", "Silk Screening", "RFID/UID Marking", "Helical & Contra-Helical Cable Layup", "Automatic Mix & Dispense & Low-Pressure Molding", "Polyurethane Molding, Encapsulating, & Potting", "Protective Jacketing & Taping", "Conformal Coating conforming to Mil-I-46058C", "Automated Testing (DC HIPOT/Dielectric Withstand up to 1500VDC, Continuity, DC Resistance, Programmable Automated Point-to-Point Testers up to 2500 points)", "Build to Print Production & Contract MFG", "MIS-38630 Cable Fabrication"], "industries": ["Defense", "Aerospace", "Military"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Programmable Automated Point-to-Point Testers", "Automatic Wire Cut & Strip machines", "Laser Stripping equipment", "Laser Wire Marking systems", "Automatic Mix & Dispense & Low-Pressure Molding equipment", "DC HIPOT/Dielectric Withstand testers (up to 1500VDC)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Lean Six Sigma methodology applied across all manufacturing and office areas", "38,500 sq. ft. facility certified to AS9100 and ISO 9001", "Supports major defense programs including MLRS and HIMARS", "Five-time Small Business of the Year award winner", "Automated testing up to 2,500 points with DC hipot to 1,500 VDC"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1968 -> /about", "Headquarters in Brownsboro, Alabama -> db", "38,500 sq. ft. facility -> /capabilities", "Capabilities include cable and wire harness fabrication, electro-mechanical assembly, over-molding, potting, conformal coating, automated testing -> /capabilities", "Certified to AS9100 and ISO 9001 -> /quality and /capabilities", "Serves Department of Defense and prime contractors like Lockheed Martin -> /about", "Supports MLRS and HIMARS programs -> /about", "Five-time Small Business of the Year winner (2000, 2004, 2007, 2009, 2013) -> /about", "2007 Nunn-Perry Award recipient -> /about", "Secretary of Defense PBL Award 2006 and 2009 -> /about", "Lean Six Sigma principles used -> /quality and /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "R&D Electronics\u2019 38,500 sq. ft. facility produces a wide variety of semi-complex to complex electronic, electro-mechanical assemblies, cable, and wiring harness manufacturing to demanding military specifications.", "founded_year": "1968", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='r-d-electronics-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='R & E Tooling & Plastics Inc operates from Haltom City, Texas, in the Fort Worth metro area. The company was founded in 1970 and has accumulated 56 years in business, with a team that collectively holds 125 years of experience in plastic injection molding.

Services span mold design, tooling (including overseas sourcing), 3D printing, prototype and first-part runs, short R&D runs, and high-volume production. Secondary operations include assembly, hot stamping, post-processing, cooling, and custom packaging. The facility operates around the clock, 24 hours a day, and uses CAD/CAM technology for tool design, repair, and engineering modifications.

