UPDATE companies SET description='RAM Fabrication is headquartered in Sterling, Virginia, with additional facilities in Raleigh, Alexandria, Augusta, Orlando, Fredericksburg, and a corporate office in Ashburn. Today the operation is led by second‑generation owners Peter Padiotis (President), Ted Padiotis (Vice President), and Len Johnson (Vice President), who collectively bring over 100 years of management experience in HVAC and sheet metal fabrication.

