UPDATE companies SET description='Renovation Manufacturing is a U.S.-based apparel manufacturing company headquartered in Houston, Texas. Founded with the mission to support fashion brands at every stage of growth, the company provides full-service cut-and-sew production for emerging startups, growing labels, and established brands.

