UPDATE companies SET description='Rich Industries Import Auto Parts has operated from Kansas City, Missouri since 1968. The company was founded as a source for new and used automotive components and has remained at the same Winchester Avenue location for over five decades.

The business supplies new and used auto parts with a focus on import vehicles, and supplements its inventory with nationwide parts locating and direct shipping services. It also runs an import auto restoration program and sells used and salvage vehicles. The facility provides cut sheets for unibody, full-frame, SUV, minivan, and truck configurations to aid part identification, and uses the Car-Part Interchange system for cross-referencing.

The company emphasizes service to the Kansas City metro area while fulfilling orders nationally through its eBay store and direct shipping.

