UPDATE companies SET description='Rock Valley Textiles Inc. was founded in 1989 in Janesville, Wisconsin, as a family-owned textile manufacturer. The company began with a focus on industrial high pile fabric production using a sliver knitting process, establishing itself as a dedicated supplier for specialized fabric applications.

